      "message": "Merge upstream/main (744c0847b) into issue/2055-do-not-touch\n\nConflicts in project/apply.rs, do_not_touch.rs, model_link.rs and\nsketch_project.rs take main's side. Main moved the persistence and\nreader-barrier checks of do_not_touch.rs into do_not_touch_project.rs\n(protected_project_roundtrips_and_refuses_a_future_version), which holds\neach check of the dropped block and adds the v72 reader simulation.\n\nRefs #2055\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
